<title>USA: PHLX to open PennCorp Financial options April 21.</title>
<headline>PHLX to open PennCorp Financial options April 21.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadephia Stock Exchange said Wednesday it would open options on PennCorp Financial Group Inc April 21.</p>
<p>PennCorp Financial Group, an insurance holding company, underwrites and markets life, accident, fixed-benefit and sickness insurance through its various subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Its options will trade on the February expiration cycle, with initial expiries in May, June, August and November. Opening strike prices will be 25, 30 and 35, PHLX said.</p>
